    "detailed_description": "Push battle Royal is a battle royale game that challenges players to survive and eliminate other players while navigating through shrinking zones on a hostile island. In this game, the primary goal is to stay alive and be the last person or team standing.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331780/extras/c9f6f76ec5ffa686fc94dc90f4c9a731.poster.avif?t=1679737661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331780/extras/c9f6f76ec5ffa686fc94dc90f4c9a731.webm?t=1679737661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331780/extras/c9f6f76ec5ffa686fc94dc90f4c9a731.mp4?t=1679737661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Players can use a wide range of weapons, gear, and tactics to outsmart and overpower their opponents.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331780/extras/84250740f48c2d9441ec9061b4d7a0c3.poster.avif?t=1679737661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331780/extras/84250740f48c2d9441ec9061b4d7a0c3.webm?t=1679737661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331780/extras/84250740f48c2d9441ec9061b4d7a0c3.mp4?t=1679737661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The game is fast-paced and requires quick reflexes, strategic thinking, and teamwork to succeed.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331780/extras/ec99ca0f9adf6fbf656669622d8124d0.poster.avif?t=1679737661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331780/extras/ec99ca0f9adf6fbf656669622d8124d0.webm?t=1679737661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331780/extras/ec99ca0f9adf6fbf656669622d8124d0.mp4?t=1679737661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>With its thrilling gameplay, immersive graphics, and engaging mechanics, Push battle Royal is a popular choice for gamers who love adrenaline-fueled action and intense competition.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331780/extras/c421cdbe5a3e97b83f9f7920996dcd8f.poster.avif?t=1679737661\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331780/extras/c421cdbe5a3e97b83f9f7920996dcd8f.webm?t=1679737661\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2331780/extras/c421cdbe5a3e97b83f9f7920996dcd8f.mp4?t=1679737661\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
